25,2,1,talk,Shizue,,It seems our schedules are often delayed by weather and unexpected hazardous materials in the old walls.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
26,2,1,talk,Yumi,,"I found that general rooms are always full, while specialist ones are empty, and off-site hiring is expensive.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
27,2,1,talk,George,,"Our technicians are wasting hours on manual tasks that equipment should handle, and we are short-staffed elsewhere.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
28,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,"Projects for comfort often slip, and users prefer spaces that are open for booking across departments.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
29,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Mechanical costs are rising sharply, and we have no reserve for replacing old audiovisual equipment.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
30,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@George, it sounds like the staff are quite burdened. Perhaps we should prioritize something that eases their load?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Mizuki, if people want bookable spaces, maybe we should look for a project that provides that!","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,2,talk,George,,"Indeed, the manual routines are a drain. Efficiency in the labs would be a great relief.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Yumi, I agree. A general-purpose space would likely be rated much higher than a niche facility.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"We must be careful. If we choose something with heavy mechanical needs, the budget may not hold.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"@Benjamin, that is a fair point. Outdoor work also seems risky given the weather delays I saw.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,3,talk,Yumi,,But we really need more study space! The booking data was quite shocking.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,3,talk,George,,"The lab technicians are struggling. It is not just about the students, but the staff too.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,We need a balance between user demand and the reality of our delivery schedules.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"If we avoid complex new builds and focus on upgrades, we might avoid the worst cost overruns.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,4,talk,Shizue,,I feel we are narrowing it down. Let us see the candidates and decide.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,4,talk,Yumi,,I can't wait to see the options!,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,4,talk,George,,As long as the staff's burden is considered.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,4,talk,Mizuki,,Agreed. Let us proceed.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,Very well.,"{""words"":2,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
