50,3,1,talk,Shizue,,"We have the Path Network, Media Center, Study Commons, and Lab Ventilation. The paths seem prone to weather delays.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,3,1,talk,Yumi,,The Study Commons sounds perfect! It solves the booking shortage and provides the general space people want.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,3,1,talk,George,,The Lab Ventilation Upgrade is the only one that addresses the technicians' manual routines and efficiency.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,3,1,talk,Mizuki,,The Study Commons aligns with the post-occupancy data. The Media Center is too specialist.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,3,1,talk,Benjamin,,"The Lab Ventilation involves mechanical plant, which is expensive, but the Media Center lacks a renewal reserve.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,3,2,talk,Shizue,,"@George, the ventilation upgrade would certainly help the staff. But @Yumi, the Commons helps so many students.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""George"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,2,talk,Yumi,,"@George, wouldn't the Commons be easier to build than ventilation systems?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,2,talk,George,,"Perhaps, but the lab situation is a matter of daily operational failure.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Benjamin, would the Commons be cheaper than the ventilation upgrade?","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Likely. It is a conversion of an existing hall, avoiding the rising costs of heavy mechanical installations.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,3,talk,Shizue,,"I am torn, but I think the staff's well-being is paramount. I lean toward the labs.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,3,talk,Yumi,,I still think the Study Commons is the best for the most people!,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,3,talk,George,,I must insist on the Lab Ventilation. The current situation is unsustainable for the technicians.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,3,talk,Mizuki,,I will vote for the Study Commons. The data on room demand is too strong to ignore.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,3,talk,Benjamin,,Logic suggests the Study Commons is the safest bet for budget and user satisfaction.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,4,talk,Shizue,,"I will follow the majority if they are certain. I'll vote for the labs, though.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,4,talk,Yumi,,I'm voting for the Commons!,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,4,talk,George,,My vote is for the Lab Ventilation.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,4,talk,Mizuki,,Study Commons for me.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,4,talk,Benjamin,,I vote for the Study Commons.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
